<title>USA: Thornburg president/COO buys 1,580 shares.</title>
<headline>Thornburg president/COO buys 1,580 shares.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA FE, N.M. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thornburg Mortgage Asset Corp said Friday that its president and chief operating officer Larry Goldstone had bought 1,580 Thornburg shares.</p>
<p>It said 1,000 shares were purchased on the open market at $18.375 each on April 11, and 580 shares were purchased through the company's dividend reinvestment and stock purchase plan at $19.357 each on April 10.</p>
</text>
